UR  - https://www.iiba.org/business-analysis-blogs/why-defining-the-business-need-is-critical/
AB  - This article emphasizes the importance of clearly defining the business need before initiating any project or change. It outlines how a well-articulated business need provides purpose, increases motivation, reduces conflict, and enhances stakeholder satisfaction. The author discusses the role of Business Analysts in guiding organizations to identify and define business needs, ensuring alignment with strategic goals and objectives.
KW  - Business Analysis, Business Need, Stakeholder Alignment, Project Success, Organizational Change
